        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 0672, Double Cylinder Heavy Duty Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Weslock Extra Heavy Duty Double Cylinder Deadbolt uses a key on the outside and inside. It exceeds ANSI A 156.2 Grade 2 cylindrical lock standards. Easy to install, this Weslock made deadbolt fits standard 2-1/8 inch bore holes. Available in 4 finish choices. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Weslock Heavy Duty Double Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exceeds ANSI A 156.2 Grade 2 Cylindrical lock standards.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty security strike with 3\" screws.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard doors prepared with 2-1/8\" cross holes and 1\" edge hole.</li>\r\n<li>5-pin lock cylinders.</li>\r\n<li>1\" throw deadbolt with two hardened steel rollers.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty 1/4\" diameter through bolts.</li>\r\n<li>Rotating collar for extra anti wrench security.</li>\r\n<li>Heat treated assemble housing screws.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-force shield.</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Weslock Heavy Duty Double Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable latches for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" with removable faceplate</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjusts to from 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on both the interior and exterior. <br>\r\nNote: Not recommend for use on emergency exit doors. \r\n</p>",
