                "description": "Weslock Heavy Duty Double Cylinder Deadbolt - The Weslock Extra Heavy Duty Double Cylinder Deadbolt uses a key on the outside and inside. It exceeds ANSI A 156.2 Grade 2 cylindrical lock standards. Easy to install, this Weslock made deadbolt fits standard 2-1/8 inch bore holes. Available in 4 finish choices. \r\n",
